For each attack the opponent misses before the [[Broom]] attacks, it gains +2 damage for that attack only. When it hits the bonus damage gets reset to 0.

The Broom has multiple one-step crafts in the early-game, but it is also the starting point for all [[Staff]]s in the game, once the [[Magic Staff]] is created from the Broom + [[Mana Orb]].

